Scenario A transaction already imported, with no identifier, is a duplicate on its day
Description The case a history brought over from Quicken makes ordinary. T1 came
\ in with that history: it is cleared, because the bank had already
\ posted it when Quicken was told about it, and it carries no FITID,
\ because a QIF has none to carry. Downloading the same month from the
\ bank reaches it again.
Details The dates agree exactly, and they agree because both are the bank's
\ own posting date -- one recorded through Quicken, one read out of
\ the file today. So this is the transaction, not something that looks
\ like it, and the import says Duplicate.
\
\ It is the FITID being absent that brings this test into play at all.
\ Where there is one, test one has already settled the question.
Given the chart of accounts is : ChartOfAccounts
| Path                   | Type     | Placeholder |
| Assets:Checking        | Checking | false       |
| Expenses:Groceries     | Expense  | false       |
| Expenses:Uncategorized | Expense  | false       |
And transactions are : ImportedTransaction
| Ref | SourceAccount   | Date       | Payee         | Destination        | Amount | Cleared | FitId |
| T1  | Assets:Checking | 2024-01-16 | Harris Teeter | Expenses:Groceries | -45.00 | Cleared | none  |
And import target is : ImportTarget Vertical
| AccountPath | Assets:Checking |
When transactions imported : OfxTransactions
| TrnType | DatePosted | Amount | FitId       | Name               | Memo | CheckNum |
| DEBIT   | 2024-01-16 | -45.00 | 20240116009 | HARRIS TEETER #231 | none | none     |
Then import summary is : ImportSummary Vertical
| New       | 0 |
| Duplicate | 1 |
| Possible  | 0 |
And transactions are : ImportedTransaction
| Ref | SourceAccount   | Date       | Payee         | Destination        | Amount | Cleared | FitId       |
| T1  | Assets:Checking | 2024-01-16 | Harris Teeter | Expenses:Groceries | -45.00 | Cleared | 20240116009 |
# One transaction, the one that was already there. It keeps the payee and the
# category it was given and gains the identifier it never had, so the next
# download of the same month settles on test one and nothing is asked twice.

