# The three 3,000.00 pairs are not interchangeable even though they look
# alike: each is paired with the half of its own date, closest date first.

BusinessRule Which half pairs with which when several match
Description Closest date first, and then the order the files were read. A half
\ that has been paired is out of the running for the rest.
Examples: CandidatePriority
| Test | Condition                                             |
| 1    | The pair whose dates are closest together is formed first |
| 2    | A tie goes to the earlier date                        |
| 3    | A further tie goes to the order the files were read   |
| 4    | A half already paired is not offered again            |

Attributes CandidatePriority
| Attribute | Type    | Default |
| Test      | Integer | 0       |
| Condition | String  |         |

