Scenario A disagreement with the stated balance is reported
Description The usual cause is a transaction entered by hand that the bank has
\ not seen, wrongly marked cleared. The number is what makes it
\ findable, so it is shown rather than hidden.
Given the chart of accounts is : ChartOfAccounts
| Path                   | Type    | Placeholder |
| Assets:Checking        | Checking | false       |
| Expenses:Uncategorized | Expense | false       |
And transactions are : ImportedTransaction
| Ref | SourceAccount   | Date       | Destination | Amount  | Cleared | FitId |
| T0  | Assets:Checking | 2024-01-01 | none        | 1750.00 | Cleared | none  |
| T9  | Assets:Checking | 2024-01-20 | none        | -100.00 | Cleared | none  |
When ledger balance checked : LedgerBalanceCheck Vertical
| Account     | Assets:Checking |
| StatedBal   | 1750.00         |
| StatedBalAt | 2024-01-31      |
Then balance check is : LedgerBalanceResult Vertical
| ClearedBalance | 1650.00 |
| StatedBal      | 1750.00 |
| Difference     | -100.00 |
| Agrees         | false   |

Scenario Only cleared transactions count towards the stated balance
Description A check written but not yet presented is in the register and not at
\ the bank. Counting it would make every import look wrong.
Given the chart of accounts is : ChartOfAccounts
| Path                   | Type    | Placeholder |
| Assets:Checking        | Checking | false       |
| Expenses:Uncategorized | Expense | false       |
And transactions are : ImportedTransaction
| Ref | SourceAccount   | Date       | Destination | Amount  | Cleared   | FitId |
| T0  | Assets:Checking | 2024-01-01 | none        | 1750.00 | Cleared   | none  |
| T9  | Assets:Checking | 2024-01-29 | none        | -250.00 | Uncleared | none  |
When ledger balance checked : LedgerBalanceCheck Vertical
| Account     | Assets:Checking |
| StatedBal   | 1750.00         |
| StatedBalAt | 2024-01-31      |
Then balance check is : LedgerBalanceResult Vertical
| ClearedBalance | 1750.00 |
| StatedBal      | 1750.00 |
| Difference     | 0.00    |
| Agrees         | true    |
